                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The environment was clean and tidy.\nThe music was pleasant.\nThe corn soup was delicious ❤️\nThere were quite a few dishes on the menu, and I wanted to try them all.\nThe red sauce Mexican chili rice was tasty and the portion was generous.\nHowever, I was a little bothered by the chef not wearing a hat, gloves, or mask while handling the food, and even talking while cooking (although it wasn\u0027t my portion).\n\nI hope they can improve this.\n\nLine Pay is available.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "環境乾淨整潔\n音樂好聽\n玉米湯是有料的❤️\n菜單上蠻多種都想嘗試的\n紅醬墨西哥辣椒飯 口味不錯\n份量也足\n但我有點介意廚師料理時\n沒戴帽子手套口罩 觸碰食物\n也在料理中開口說話（雖然不是做我的那份）\n\n加油希望可改善\n\n可line pay",
